OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAMatron awarded for reducing
OL,4,Achildren's hospital fear
OL,5,
OL,6,FFor children facing hospital treatment,
OL,7,Ffear can sometimes be as difficult as
OL,8,Fthe procedure itself.
OL,10,FAt the Royal London Hospital, matron
OL,11,FAlison Klufio has been working to
OL,12,Fchange that by helping staff reduce the
OL,13,Fdistress and potential trauma children
OL,14,Fcan experience during treatment.
OL,16,FHer commitment has now earned her the
OL,17,FProtector of Play Award 2026 by
OL,18,FStarlight, a charity which supports
OL,19,Fchildren's play in healthcare.
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
